msgid "owner"
msgstr "propietario"

msgid "member"
msgstr "miembro"

msgid "collaborator"
msgstr "colaborador"

msgid "contributor"
msgstr "contribuidor"

msgid "first-timer"
msgstr "primerizo"

msgid ""
"The type of the author comes from GitHub, with each pull request: owner of "
"the repository, member of its organization, collaborator, contributor with "
"earlier contributions, or first-timer, whose first contribution it is. They "
"are exclusive: an author has exactly one type for a pull request, the most "
"privileged."
msgstr ""
"El tipo del autor viene de GitHub, con cada pull request: propietario del "
"repositorio, miembro de su organización, colaborador, contribuidor con "
"contribuciones anteriores o primerizo, cuya primera contribución es. Son "
"excluyentes: un autor tiene exactamente un tipo para un pull request, el de "
"más privilegios."

