"GitHub tells %(site_name)s who you are, your email addresses and your "
"organizations; it only reads. There are no passwords on %(site_name)s. "
"Signing in adds your account, your preferences and your projects."
msgstr ""
"GitHub le dice a %(site_name)s quién eres, tus direcciones de correo y tus "
"organizaciones; solo lee. En %(site_name)s no hay contraseñas. Iniciar "
"sesión añade tu cuenta, tus preferencias y tus proyectos."

#, python-format
